{"id":"05f15a105b760502","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-string-rewriting-system.md","title":"字符串重写系统","display":"df-string-rewriting-system — 字符串重写系统","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-string-rewriting-system","aliases":["56-df-string-rewriting-system"],"display":"df-string-rewriting-system — 字符串重写系统","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Terese (2003), §3.4.4, printed p78","source_ocr_block":"99","source_status":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-string-rewriting-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-string-rewriting-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-string-rewriting-system — 字符串重写系统"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), §3.4.4, printed p78"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"99"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为有限字母表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^*=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}A^n\">\\(A^*=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}A^n\\)</span> 包含空串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span>，串连接写为并置。给定规则集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq A^*\\times A^*\">\\(R\\subseteq A^*\\times A^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v\\in A^*\">\\(u,v\\in A^*\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SRS}(A,R)\\Longleftrightarrow|A|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land R\\subseteq A^*\\times A^*.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SRS}(A,R)\\Longleftrightarrow|A|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land R\\subseteq A^*\\times A^*.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u\\Rightarrow_R v\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists p,q\\in A^*\\;\\exists(l,r)\\in R\\;(u=plq\\land v=prq).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u\\Rightarrow_R v\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists p,q\\in A^*\\;\\exists(l,r)\\in R\\;(u=plq\\land v=prq).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §3.4.4（印刷 p78，OCR 页块99）。字符串按连接本身的结合性处理，不把连接当成无等式约束的一阶二元构造子。此集合论定义允许空左部；转换为普通 TRS 的下一节点另作非空左部限制。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A^*=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}A^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq A^*\\times A^*","display":false},{"tex":"u,v\\in A^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SRS}(A,R)\\Longleftrightarrow|A|<\\aleph_0\\land R\\subseteq A^*\\times A^*.","display":true},{"tex":"u\\Rightarrow_R v\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists p,q\\in A^*\\;\\exists(l,r)\\in R\\;(u=plq\\land v=prq).","display":true}],"bytes":1103,"backlinks":[{"id":"ac4f2389d6a4143b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-265","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-string-rewriting-system.md]]"}],"outgoing":[]}